    "body": "Right — so the if-statement “artifact” gets moved up, but hasn’t actually gone away. And although that example doesn’t illustrate it cause it was 1:1, it multiplies it, too — an additional new if statement for each abortable-awaited-thing, instead of just one for all of them.",
